{#
  /brand/[slug]/index.html — Jinja2 template for brand hub pages.

  Renders one brand from src/content/brands/<slug>.json + lender rows joined
  by lenders.brand_slug. Matches Astro's [brand].astro schema surface.
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ description|striptags|truncate(160, killwords=True, end='') }}">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.creditdoc.co/brand/{{ brand.slug }}/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="{{ title }}">
<meta property="og:description" content="{{ description|striptags|truncate(200, killwords=True, end='') }}">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://www.creditdoc.co/brand/{{ brand.slug }}/">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="CreditDoc">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://www.creditdoc.co/og-default.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ org_jsonld|safe }}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ collection_jsonld|safe }}
</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ breadcrumb_jsonld|safe }}
</script>
{% if faq_jsonld %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ faq_jsonld|safe }}
</script>
{% endif %}
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-bg text-text antialiased">
{% include "_header.html" %}
<main>
  <nav class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pt-6 sm:px-6 lg:px-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted">
      <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Home</a></li>
      <li><span class="mx-1">/</span></li>
      <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">Brands</a></li>
      <li><span class="mx-1">/</span></li>
      <li class="text-text font-medium">{{ brand.display_name }}</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-text">{{ brand.display_name }} Locations</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-muted leading-relaxed">{{ brand.summary_short }}</p>

      <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        {% if avg_google_rating > 0 %}
        <div class="glass-card px-4 py-2 text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="text-yellow-400 text-base">&#9733;</span><span class="font-semibold text-text">{{ '%.1f' % avg_google_rating }}</span><span class="text-muted">avg Google rating across {{ google_rating_count }} location{{ 's' if google_rating_count != 1 else '' }}</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="glass-card px-4 py-2 text-sm"><span class="font-semibold text-text">{{ location_count }}</span><span class="text-muted ml-1">locations</span></div>
        <div class="glass-card px-4 py-2 text-sm"><span class="font-semibold text-text">{{ states_count }}</span><span class="text-muted ml-1">states</span></div>
        {% if services_list %}
        <div class="glass-card px-4 py-2 text-sm"><span class="font-semibold text-text">{{ services_list|length }}</span><span class="text-muted ml-1">services</span></div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="glass-card px-4 py-2 text-sm"><span class="text-muted">Category:</span><a href="/categories/{{ brand.category }}/" class="ml-1 font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">{{ brand.category.replace('-', ' ') }}</a></div>
      </div>

      {% if brand.summary_long %}
      <div class="mt-6 prose max-w-none">
        {% for para in linked_summary %}
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">{{ para|safe }}</p>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if services_list %}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Services Offered</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {% for service in services_list %}
        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 text-sm rounded-full bg-surface text-muted border border-border">{{ service }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if top_pros or top_cons %}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      {% if top_pros %}
      <div class="glass-card p-5">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Strengths</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          {% for pro in top_pros %}<li class="text-sm text-muted flex gap-2"><span class="text-green-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">+</span><span>{{ pro }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if top_cons %}
      <div class="glass-card p-5">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Things to Consider</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          {% for con in top_cons %}<li class="text-sm text-muted flex gap-2"><span class="text-red-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">–</span><span>{{ con }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  {% if company_hq or company_founded or bbb_rating or phone_number %}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text mb-3">Company Details</h2>
      <dl class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm">
        {% if company_founded %}<div><dt class="text-muted">Founded</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-text mt-0.5">{{ company_founded }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if company_hq %}<div class="col-span-2"><dt class="text-muted">Headquarters</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-text mt-0.5">{{ company_hq }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if bbb_rating %}<div><dt class="text-muted">BBB Rating</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-text mt-0.5">{{ bbb_rating }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if phone_number %}<div><dt class="text-muted">Phone</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-text mt-0.5"><a href="tel:{{ phone_number }}" class="text-primary hover:underline">{{ phone_number }}</a></dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if brand.official_website %}<div class="col-span-2"><dt class="text-muted">Official Website</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-text mt-0.5"><a href="{{ brand.official_website }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="text-primary hover:underline">{{ brand.official_website }}</a></dd></div>{% endif %}
        {% if brand.parent_company %}<div class="col-span-2"><dt class="text-muted">Parent Company</dt><dd class="font-semibold text-text mt-0.5">{{ brand.parent_company }}</dd></div>{% endif %}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text mb-4">All {{ brand.display_name }} Locations by State</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      {% for state, state_lenders in states_grouped %}
      <details class="glass-card"{% if loop.index0 < 3 %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="font-semibold text-text">{{ state }}<span class="ml-2 text-sm font-normal text-muted">({{ state_lenders|length }} location{{ 's' if state_lenders|length != 1 else '' }})</span></span>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-4 pb-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-2">
          {% for lender in state_lenders %}
          <article class="glass-card p-4 flex flex-col gap-2">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-text"><a href="/review/{{ lender.slug }}/" class="hover:text-primary transition-colors">{{ lender.name }}</a></h3>
            {% if lender.city %}<p class="text-xs text-muted">{{ lender.city }}{% if lender.state %}, {{ lender.state }}{% endif %}</p>{% endif %}
            {% if lender.company_info and lender.company_info.bbb_rating %}<p class="text-xs text-muted">BBB {{ lender.company_info.bbb_rating }}</p>{% endif %}
            <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">{{ (lender.description_short or lender.meta_description or 'Review this ' ~ brand.display_name ~ ' location profile.')|striptags|truncate(280, killwords=True, end='') }} This {{ brand.display_name }} listing is part of the CreditDoc directory. Review pricing, refund policy, licensing, and public complaint context on the full profile before contacting the branch. Every {{ brand.display_name }} location links back to a full CreditDoc review with sourced fields.</p>
            <a href="/review/{{ lender.slug }}/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">View Details →</a>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if brand.faq %}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions About {{ brand.display_name }}</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      {% for item in linked_faq %}
      <details class="glass-card p-5">
        <summary class="text-base font-semibold text-text cursor-pointer">{{ item.q }}</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">{{ item.a|safe }}</p>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pb-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="glass-card p-5 space-y-3 text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <p><strong class="text-text">About this {{ brand.display_name }} page:</strong> CreditDoc aggregates public location, contact, and rating data for {{ brand.display_name }} across the United States. Each location links to a full CreditDoc profile with sourced fields, BBB rating context, and public complaint signals from the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau where available. Compare {{ brand.display_name }} listings side by side with peer providers in the same category before contacting a specific branch.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-text">How to use this brand hub:</strong> Use the state-grouped locations above to jump to a specific {{ brand.display_name }} branch near you. Every branch profile shows what services are offered, whether the location is licensed, and how it compares to peer providers in the same city. When comparing brands, look for consistency in pricing disclosure, service listings, refund policies, and licensing across every branch — brand-level consistency is a strong signal of a well-run provider.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-text">Data sourcing:</strong> Location addresses, contact numbers, and website URLs are collected from provider disclosures. BBB rating and accreditation status come from the Better Business Bureau. Google rating and review-count signals are shown only where at least one stored review is available. Public complaint context comes from the CFPB Consumer Complaint Database. All fields on the underlying profile pages are dated and sourced.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 pb-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-lg bg-bg-alt border border-border p-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-text">Affiliate Disclosure:</strong> CreditDoc may earn a commission when you click links to products and services featured on this page. Compensation does not determine whether a provider can be covered or how visible star ratings are calculated. <a href="/disclosure/" class="text-primary hover:underline">Learn more</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
{% include "_footer.html" %}
</body>
</html>
